@startuml Singleton

title Singleton Pattern - Registration Manager

class RegistrationManager {
    - _instance : RegistrationManager
    - registration_count : int
    - registrations : list

    + __new__() : RegistrationManager
    + register_course(student_name, course) : str
    + get_total_registrations() : int
}

RegistrationManager --> RegistrationManager : creates/returns\nsingle instance

note right of RegistrationManager
    Ensures only one
    RegistrationManager
    instance exists.
end note

@enduml